      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我跟艾尼斯风神签下的临时契约期就这样开始了。\r\n既然机会难得，我就想尽我所能做些事。话虽如此――",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b0314e720c9921879ebd6a9ea060242e428c285df107c3ac5b66aebf684690a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
