    {
      "uid": "zhcn:967ba052809245c7cd3233ec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这几天，我看到了，她是一个只要『跑步』就会不顾一切\r\n的马娘，即便只是训练也如此。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e399ee01e1e1cb0684966afa35bcb24ea923847c7b12bc99549c59dc44360c32",
